# badversion.poke -- a handshake asking for major version 9.
#
# ABI.md section 3.1: the major version is NEVER negotiated, because there
# is no compatible subset. The broker answers VERSION and exits. Note it is
# the BROKER that compares, not the program -- a numeric comparison is cheap
# in C and expensive in brainfuck, and a program that got it wrong would
# misbehave in a way nobody could debug.
#   hello  op 01, len 10, asking for major version 9
EMIT 01 0a 00 42 53 54 4d 09 00 00 00 00 00
READ 3
